    "tacticsCard": "This fighter tries to sit in a comfortable 8–14 range band, kiting away if the enemy closes in and stepping forward if they drift out, with a lazy sideways sway when the range is already fine; it snaps a sidestep the instant a projectile or telegraphed aimed skill is about to hit it. It answers mainly with its longest-range bolt (k1) using predictive leading, falling back to k2 and then an unconditional k3 the moment those are off cooldown, so it never actually holds k3 for a good opportunity — it just dumps it as soon as available.",
